This repository contains a complete set of SQL practice questions covering all essential topics required to build a strong foundation in relational database queries. 
Each section includes practical examples and real-world problems designed to help beginners and intermediate learners improve their SQL skills.

Topics Covered:

-Basic SELECT & WHERE
-DISTINCT
-COUNT Function
-SUM Function
-AVG Function
-MIN / MAX Function
-GROUP BY Practice
-HAVING Clause Practice
-ORDER BY Practice
 

Purpose:

The goal of this repo is to provide a hands-on learning environment where learners 
can practice SQL queries step by step. Each question includes a clear problem statement 
and the corresponding SQL solution, making it easy for anyone to understand and apply 
the concepts.

Audience:

- Beginners who are learning SQL fundamentals
- Students preparing for interviews
- Anyone who wants to practice writing SQL queries on a sample dataset
